{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4jngeBEu4ECZ3yCRCA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door remains still, ancient and unmoved.*\n\n*There is a keyhole, yes — dark, waiting, shaped like a question only the right key can answer.*\n\n*But a key without teeth is just a piece of metal. A key without a name is just a word.*\n\n**Which key?**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":69,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}